message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the associated article when available."
title: "industrial_ts: Industrial Time-Series Modeling Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Petrus Domingues"
    given-names: "Rodrigo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rod260185/industrial_ts"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-09"
abstract: >-
  industrial_ts is a PyTorch toolkit for industrial time-series modeling with
  a shared API for recurrent, ODE-based, and PatchTST-style models,
  including support for imputation, forecasting, probabilistic decoding, and
  future-time anomaly/event prediction.
preferred-citation:
